text.section:
The Secretary of the Commonwealth shall maintain an electronic database of collegial bodies to which the Governor makes appointments. The database shall be organized by collegial body and include the following information:

Authority for each appointment;


Term length and term expiration dates for each appointee;


Eligibility requirements or other restrictions affecting the next appointment;


Name, address, and telephone number of each appointee;


Identity of the chairman and vice-chairman and the method of their election; and


Name of the affiliated agency or entity that provides staff support and the name and telephone number of the contact person within such agency or entity.
